                                "sense_id": "8137a078-5faa-37ba-ac08-0ae6173e6c45",
                                "text": "Damn heng... The bus tire puncture right before my stop. Bad luck everyone else though."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c45694df-8fc7-4521-af88-fc17d81a1c67",
                                "sense_id": "8137a078-5faa-37ba-ac08-0ae6173e6c45",
                                "text": "But Sunny very heng [lucky]... No damage on the driver's side."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "99b3e47b-9d51-450c-b294-3162a1063b06",
                                "sense_id": "8137a078-5faa-37ba-ac08-0ae6173e6c45",
                                "text": "Most Heng is join few month before June 2021. Your pay got adjusted to $4900 with all the new joiners in June + got 5k bonus."
                            }
                        ]
